' ShowEntrances held (Alt, the left trigger; `preset classic ai none seed 3
' start 30 party`: a companion handed over and camped at Paradise Camp, a
' prepared state). v1.2 sets `ShowAllEntrances` while the action is down
' (MapScene.cs:435, LocationScene.cs:520; `MapViewOverlayHoverText.cs:
' 92-134`): in a place every door's title (or "Blocked" in another's
' place) but the hovered one's, at 0.7, without marks; on the world map
' every place the player holds but the labelled one, at 0.7, on its
' half-black with its marks. Snapshots while held and after.
press escape             ' Back closes the manual v1.2 opens on a new game's first world map (MapScene.cs:687-691)
mapclick 110,122         ' into Paradise Camp
wait 60
join                     ' camped here: the place is ours
wait 10
holdkey alt 300          ' every door's title
wait 2
snap entrances_place
wait 30
snap entrances_place_let_go
esc                      ' the world map
wait 10
mapmove 300,40           ' the pointer on no place
holdkey alt 300          ' the camp's name and marks
wait 2
snap entrances_map
wait 30
snap entrances_map_let_go
quit
